# Regression test: an unknown flag must be classified as a usage error
# (exit code 64, message "usage error: ..."), not as a generic internal failure.
# Also asserts urfave's default "Incorrect Usage" preamble is not printed,
# so the user never sees a duplicated stderr line.
! hexlet-path-size --bogus file.txt
! stdout .
stderr '^usage error:'
! stderr 'Incorrect Usage'

-- file.txt --
hello
